8. Transfer it to another operator. This purchase does not grant unrelated
   server operators a licence. Servers you administer are covered by clause 1.

SOURCE

It ships as readable Lua on purpose. There is no obfuscation, no escrow and no
phone-home. You can read every rule that governs your server, and you should:
`audit-accepted.json` lists what a resource checker will flag and why, and
README.md explains the design. Nothing in this resource contacts any server but
your own.

